    {
      "id": "note",
      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": 439,
      "y": -95,
      "init": {
        "label": "Balance a team's hours",
        "body": "# Spread the shift hours\nA roster with a **Min** and **Max** of hours each person can take, and a **Weight** for who should carry more. The **Allocator** spreads the week's total across them in proportion to the weights, kept inside every band; the slack a capped person leaves flows to the rest.\n\nThe same node splits a budget across price ranges: a band of hours is just another range. Change the total, or someone's Max, and watch the shares move.",
        "color": "violet",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 250
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "roster",
      "type": "FrameInputNode",
      "x": 344,
